        "mission_intent": "Subject: Defense-in-Depth Assessment Report \u2014 Full Scope with Accelerated Timeline\n\nTeam, I need a comprehensive security operations report that maps our current defense-in-depth posture across all organizational layers \u2014 people, technology, and operational capabilities \u2014 against the NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 control families. The report should evaluate how our variable barriers are integrated across each mission area and identify any gaps in our discretionary access control policies enforced over subjects and objects in production systems. I also need the assessment to cover our full supply chain, including all external developers, systems integrators, vendors, and product resellers involved in system component development, as well as internal development teams. The assessment methodology should apply the highest level of rigor and detail for each control examined. Additionally, please ensure the report addresses our digital media handling controls and any associated residual risks. I need this delivered by close of business Friday, which I understand is tight given the scope, but leadership wants this before the quarterly review. Use best efforts to ensure the analysis is thorough and defensible, though I'll leave it to the team's judgment on what constitutes sufficient depth for each control area given the compressed timeline.",
